WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Give a value a name
An assignment stores a value under a variable name. Use the name later to access the current value.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Recognize the common types
A string is text, an integer is a whole number, a float has a decimal part, and a boolean is True or False.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Update a variable
The right side is evaluated first. Python takes the old score, adds five, and assigns the new value to score.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Ready to practice?
Exercise 2 checks strings and variable updates. For the exam, also review integers, booleans, and multiplication.
